---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Disclaimer"
  description="Understand the limitations of Toolsiva calculations, conversions, security utilities and generated content."
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 lg:py-16">
    <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-brand-300">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="mt-2 text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-white sm:text-4xl">Disclaimer</h1>
    <div class="prose-premium mt-10 space-y-10 text-sm leading-7 text-zinc-300">
      <section><h2>General information</h2><p>Toolsiva provides general-purpose utilities and informational output. Results are not a substitute for certified software, regulatory guidance, professional judgment or independent verification.</p></section>
      <section><h2>Calculations and conversions</h2><p>Results may use rounded values, common definitions and assumptions described by the interface. Unit standards, financial conventions and date handling can vary. Verify important values through an authoritative source.</p></section>
      <section><h2>Health and financial tools</h2><p>BMI, loan, interest, age and similar calculators are informational. They do not diagnose a condition, determine eligibility, provide a quote or account for every personal, contractual or regulatory factor.</p></section>
      <section><h2>Security and developer tools</h2><p>Generated passwords, hashes, tokens, encoded values and validation results do not guarantee security, compatibility or correctness in a production system. Review implementation requirements and current standards.</p></section>
      <section><h2>QR codes</h2><p>Review encoded content before distributing a QR code. Scanning applications, operating systems and payload formats may interpret content differently.</p></section>
      <section><h2>External services</h2><p>Toolsiva is not responsible for third-party browsers, extensions, operating systems, linked websites, infrastructure or applications used to open or process output.</p></section>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
